OL,3,GNEWSAMP supports campaign for quieter
OL,4,Afireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Leicester MP has backed government
OL,7,Fplans to reduce the noise of fireworks
OL,8,Fsold to the public.
OL,10,FShockat Adam, independent MP for
OL,11,FLeicester South, said constituents
OL,12,Ffrequently raised concerns about the
OL,13,Fimpact of fireworks on pets.
OL,15,FThe government is currently considering
OL,16,Ftighter restrictions which could see
OL,17,Fthe maximum noise of fireworks sold for
OL,18,Fprivate use cut from 120 to 110
OL,19,Fdecibels.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
