OL,3,GNEWSAMP supports campaign for quieter
OL,4,Afireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdam said: "Nobody wants to ban
OL,7,Ffireworks, but it's the hours in which
OL,8,Fthey are used, particularly after one
OL,9,Fin the morning, and the stress levels
OL,10,Fit causes to their pets."
